---
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';
---

<section id="contatti" class="py-20 bg-slate-900 dark:bg-slate-950 text-white transition-colors duration-300">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl mb-6">Mettiamoci in Contatto</h2>
    <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 dark:text-slate-400 mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto transition-colors">
      Sei interessato al mio profilo? Sono disponibile per nuove opportunità e collaborazioni. Non esitare a contattarmi.
    </p>
    
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center items-center gap-6">
      <a 
        href="mailto:alessandro.sena@pm.me" 
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-blue-600 px-8 py-4 text-lg font-semibold text-white shadow-sm hover:bg-blue-500 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-600 transition-colors w-full sm:w-auto"
      >
        <Icon name="ph:envelope-simple" class="mr-3 h-6 w-6" />
        Scrivimi un'Email
      </a>
      
      <div class="flex gap-4">
        <a 
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/senaalessandro/" 
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900 text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-blue-700 dark:hover:bg-blue-800 hover:shadow-lg transition-all"
          aria-label="Profilo LinkedIn"
        >
          <Icon name="mdi:linkedin" class="h-7 w-7" />
        </a>
        
        <a 
          href="https://github.com/senaalessandro" 
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900 text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-700 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 hover:shadow-lg transition-all"
          aria-label="Profilo GitHub"
        >
          <Icon name="mdi:github" class="h-7 w-7" />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 mt-20 pt-8 border-t border-slate-800 dark:border-slate-800/50 text-center text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500 text-sm transition-colors">
    <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Alessandro Sena. Tutti i diritti riservati.</p>
  </div>
</section>

